      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "At nightfall he reached Arcadia, to the palace of King Lycaon.",
          "es": "Al caer la noche llegó a Arcadia, al palacio del rey Licaón."
        },
        {
          "en": "Zeus showed signs that he was a god, and the people began to pray to him.",
          "es": "Zeus mostró señales de que era un dios, y la gente empezó a rezarle."
        },
        {
          "en": "But Lycaon laughed at him. He wanted to test whether this guest was really a god.",
          "es": "Pero Licaón se rió de él. Quiso probar si ese huésped era de verdad un dios."
        },
        {
          "en": "So at the banquet he served Zeus human flesh, to see if he would notice.",
          "es": "Así que en el banquete le sirvió carne humana a Zeus, para ver si lo notaba."
        }
      ],
