      "camara": {
        "de": 0,
        "a": 700
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "But Prometheus, who could see the future, had known this would happen.",
          "es": "Pero Prometeo, que podía ver el futuro, sabía que esto iba a pasar."
        },
        {
          "en": "He warned his son Deucalion and told him to build a great wooden chest.",
          "es": "Advirtió a su hijo Deucalión y le dijo que construyera un gran arcón de madera."
        },
        {
          "en": "Deucalion boarded it with his wife Pyrrha, daughter of Epimetheus and Pandora. Both were good people.",
          "es": "Deucalión subió con su esposa Pirra, hija de Epimeteo y Pandora. Los dos eran buenas personas."
        },
        {
          "en": "For nine days and nine nights they drifted over the sea that covered the world.",
          "es": "Durante nueve días y nueve noches flotaron sobre el mar que cubría el mundo."
        },
        {
          "en": "On the tenth day the chest touched ground on Mount Parnassus, the only land still showing.",
          "es": "El décimo día el arcón tocó tierra en el monte Parnaso, la única tierra que se veía."
        }
      ],
