    {
      "id": "oraculo",
      "fondo": "templo",
      "camara": {
        "de": 0,
        "a": 400
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "They went to the temple of Themis, goddess of justice, and begged her for help.",
          "es": "Fueron al templo de Temis, diosa de la justicia, y le pidieron ayuda."
        },
        {
          "en": "The goddess said: cover your heads and throw the bones of your great mother behind you.",
          "es": "La diosa dijo: cúbranse la cabeza y arrojen detrás de ustedes los huesos de su gran madre."
        },
        {
          "en": "Pyrrha was horrified. She would never insult her mother's bones that way.",
          "es": "Pirra se horrorizó. Nunca ofendería así los huesos de su madre."
        },
        {
          "en": "But Deucalion understood: the great mother is Earth, and her bones are stones.",
          "es": "Pero Deucalión entendió: la gran madre es la Tierra, y sus huesos son piedras."
        }
      ],
